              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 24:5-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I waŋceŋ acel no jacwo m'oyido obedo jatel pa jokwath dhok pa Saulo oyido nitie kenyo. Nyingi go oyido Doweg ma wok Edom. Go oyido obino kenyo timo kwer moro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi openjo Abimelek ni, “Initie gi toŋ kosa abor moro? Rupiri akitiŋo toŋ kosa gilweny moro je rupiri kere ooran ma kwakirok.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimelek odwoko ni, “Abor pa Goliath Jafilistia ma ndelo no ineko i milelo ma Ela ama nitie ka. Nitie yuŋey law pa jocway ri Were i wi migam otwey i law. K'imito kadhi gine rupiri a gilweny kende manitie ka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi owaco ni, “Miyan, doko ongoye abor kaman je maber loyo meno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
